Gentle King
===========

This repository holds two different kinds of thing, and they are offered under
two different terms.


THE WRITING
-----------

Everything written for this site, meaning the page content, the books, and any
other prose or teaching material published here, is offered under the Creative
Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives 4.0 International license.

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/

In plain words. Copy it. Print it. Hand it to your neighbor. Read it aloud in
your home or your church. Put it on a table in the back of the sanctuary. You do
not need to ask and you do not owe anything. Please do not sell it, and please do
not change the words and keep the name on it.

If you want to translate it, adapt it, or use part of it in something you are
writing, just ask. The answer will almost always be yes.


